== Miscellaneous ==

* All previous Cat Units now have a new attribute known as "Power Level" which shows how much value it has to the Cat Base's health.
* Raised [[Cat Bros (Switch Special Cat)|Cat Bros]] + level cap from +0 to +1.
* Added the Filter function, allowing players to filter through their Cat Army either by their Trait target or Abilities.

